      "created_at": "2017-04-17T15:50:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mr Fixer can gain irreducible though so it is a type to a degree. &nbsp; For example, of Mr Fixer has Dual Crowbars out and he hits a target GI Bunker used his power on the second hit from Dual Crowbars will retain irreducible damage on the second target that is hit. &nbsp;</p>",
