      "created_at": "2017-04-18T14:37:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ohh yes, good point on the Plating thing - none of his platings protect him from Irreducible damage (well, they can't short of making him outright immune, what with it being <em>irreducible</em> and all ;)) so he'll never ping that back at anyone because it's a new instance of damage taking only the \"element type\" from the incoming hit.</p>",
